 end def
	/DeviceRGB 4 dict dup begin
		/Channels 3 def
		/MarksPlate {pop isCMYKSep?} def
		/ToCMYK {pop _rgbtocmyk} def
		/ToPSSpace {} def
 end def
	/DeviceCMYK 4 dict dup begin
		/Channels 4 def
		/MarksPlate {pop isCMYKSep?} def
		/ToCMYK {pop} def
